  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with pop culture references, satirical humor, and the concept of lie detector tests. It leverages widely recognizable imagery (John Ritter's expressive face) and ironic juxtaposition (serious lie detector test text over a comedic scene) to appeal to viewers who appreciate absurdist humor and internet meme culture. The target community includes individuals who understand the satirical intent and can interpret the visual and textual elements in context, without requiring specific demographic or cultural markers beyond general media literacy.",
